{"id": 79, "name": "Granger", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f44e2457fb0f3539937c6a181e5dcbc4.png", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Finisher"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["30", "70", "10", "40"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "A mysterious demon hunter that operates outside the conventions of the Church of Light. Always seen with a violin case in hand, he hunts down demons with his two soul-devouring weapons.", "skills": [{"name": "Capriccio", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_22/100_bc047a2c81d46bab9fbb33613806eb2d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Granger's unique Demon Hunting <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cannon</span> are powered by Demonic Energy. Both his weapons start with 800 max Energy. His <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span> restores 8% Energy per second while his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cannon</span> restores 2% Energy per second. Killing a Minion / Creep permanently increases their max Energy by 6 / 6, and instantly restores their Energy by 5% / 5%, respectively. Each kill or assist on an enemy hero permanently increases both weapons' max Energy by 12 and instantly restores 10% Energy.\n\nEvery 1% Cooldown Reduction converts to 2 Physical Attack. Demonic Energy costs are not affected by Energy Cost Reduction."}, {"name": "Rhapsody", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_22/100_4d4dbe5a7f0b4f112e719be3024cf8b0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 0.3", "desc": "Granger rapidly fires 6 shot(s) with his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span>, with each shot dealing 60<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and consuming 70 <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span> Energy. The last shot is guaranteed to Crit. While firing, Granger's Movement Speed is increased by 10%.\n\nGranger stops firing when he runs out of Energy, or when the skill is cast again. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rhapsody</span> has no cooldown and can be cast once his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span> Energy is over 420."}, {"name": "Rondo", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_22/100_a33c876aa83af3bed09b1e6a8d16f638.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12", "desc": "Granger uses his Demon Hunter agility to dash in the target direction, instantly restoring 15% Energy for his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Gun</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rondo</span> can be cast while channeling <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rhapsody</span>. Each time <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rhapsody</span> hits an enemy, <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rondo's</span> Cooldown is reduced by 0.5s."}, {"name": "Death Sonata", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_22/100_228164a926a169586aec6f69aa68a128.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 0.6   Energy Cost: 250", "desc": "Granger fires his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cannon</span> in the target direction, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+110% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first enemy hero hit and other targets in the blast radius. Targets hit will be briefly slowed. Granger can roll in the Joystick's direction after each shot.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Sonata</span> can be cast while firing <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Rhapsody</span>. <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Death Sonata</span> has a brief cooldown and consumes 250 of Granger's <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Cannon</span> Energy per shot."}], "builds": [{"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 45.8, "pickRate": 31.36, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae89ce5b37dcd804686133c8d7044430.png", "attrs": ["+14 Adaptive Penetration", "+10 Adaptive Attack", "+3% Movement Speed"]}, "items": [{"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f523b2a5fb397bd5f37475b5f0b4fbd1.png"}, {"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_282edd3dffb41e1b95b08592707ba88f.png"}]}, {"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 45.3, "pickRate": 9.24, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db18518977621399c260ea44.png"}, "emblem": {"set": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae89ce5b37dcd804686133c8d7044430.png", "attrs": ["+14 Adaptive Penetration", "+10 Adaptive Attack", "+3% Movement Speed"]}, "items": [{"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f523b2a5fb397bd5f37475b5f0b4fbd1.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Roar", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_282edd3dffb41e1b95b08592707ba88f.png"}]}, {"lane": "GOLD", "winRate": 42.7, "pickRate": 2.59, "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ab75dcf8db